OL,3,GNEWSA'I picked up a rugby ball and
OL,4,Anever looked back'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former Jersey rugby captain has
OL,7,Fpraised women's rugby for "giving me
OL,8,Fsuch confidence" as a special event
OL,9,Fmarked 20 years of the sport in the
OL,10,Fisland.
OL,12,FThe founders of the first women's team
OL,13,Fcame back to Jersey to celebrate two
OL,14,Fdecades of women's rugby at Coinshare
OL,15,FPark on Saturday.
OL,17,FThey were joined by current players and
OL,18,Fmembers of the minis and junior squads
OL,19,Fas well as those from Jersey touch and
OL,20,Fwalking rugby teams.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
