OL,3,GNEWSA'I picked up a rugby ball and
OL,4,Anever looked back'
OL,5,
OL,6,FLauren Lowe, who led the side between
OL,7,F2018 and 2024, said: "I picked up the
OL,8,Frugby ball, put on my tag belt and I
OL,9,Fnever looked back after that. I think
OL,10,Fthe qualities that you gain from it is
OL,11,Fabsolutely amazing."
